flowchart LR
 L[Track is liked] --> C[Metadata cached + HMAC annotation key]
 C --> T[Tags attach to annotation key]
 C --> R[Verified sync sees removal]
 R --> A[Soft-removed archive / tags retained]
 A -->|90 days| M[Cached metadata purged]
 M -->|same track re-liked| C
 A -->|re-liked earlier| C
 T -->|disconnect confirmed| X[Annotations and account key deleted]
 M --> X